<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Una mappa gratuita per escursionisti dai dati OpenHikingMap.">
    <title>Legenda mappa OpenHikingMap</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #00386b;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .legend-section {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .legend-title {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
            color: #005691;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .legend-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            width: 30%;
            min-width: 180px;
            padding: 5px 10px 5px 0;
        }

        .legend-item img {
            margin-right: 8px;
            height: 20px;
            object-fit: contain;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .line-and-path-img img {
            height: auto;
            max-height: 20px;
            width: auto; 
        }

        .roads-paths-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px 20px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .roads-paths-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 5px 0;
        }
        
        .roads-paths-item img {
            margin-right: 8px;
            height: auto;
            max-height: 20px;
            width: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        hr {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Legenda della mappa OpenHikingMap</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Escursionismo & Sentieri (Classificazione difficoltà scala SAC)</span>
        
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                T1 / T2 / Difficoltà ignota
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="7,5"/></svg>
                T3 / T4
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1,6"/></svg>
                T5 / T6
            </li>
        </ul>

        <div style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; margin: 10px 0 5px 0; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px dashed #eee; padding-top: 5px;">
            Sentieri con scarsa visibilità del terreno:
        </div>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                T1 / T2 / Difficoltà ignota
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="7,5" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                T3 / T4
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1,6" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                T5 / T6
            </li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
            <ul class="legend-list">
                <li>
                    <img src="./legend-images/via_ferrata.png" alt="Via Ferrata">
                    Via Ferrata
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Strade sterrate e carrarecce (per veicoli)</span>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-style: italic;">
            Percorribile con i seguenti veicoli:
        </div>
        <ul class="roads-paths-list">
            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="10" x2="40" y2="10" stroke="black" stroke-width="4.6" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="10" x2="40" y2="10" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.8" />
                </svg>
                Strada asfaltata (tutti i veicoli)
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                </svg>
                Auto normali e bici da città
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="6,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                </svg>
                Auto con assetto rialzato (SUV) e marce corte
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                </svg>
                Fuoristrada pesante (4x4)
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <text x="20" y="14" font-family="Arial" font-size="11" fill="#8B4513" font-weight="bold" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.3" paint-order="stroke" text-anchor="middle">?</text>
                </svg>
                Ignoto
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Strade principali</span>
        <ul class="roads-paths-list">
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/autobahn.png" alt="Autostrada">Autostrada, Strada Statale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/landstrasse.png" alt="Strada extraurbana">Strada extraurbana / provinciale</li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/normalestrasse.png" alt="Strada locale">Strada comunale, Via locale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/strassenimbau.png" alt="In costruzione">Strada in costruzione</li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/service.png" alt="Strada di servizio">Strada di servizio</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr/>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Aree</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/laubwald.png" alt="Bosco di latifoglie">Bosco di latifoglie</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/nadelwald.png" alt="Bosco di conifere">Bosco di conifere</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/mischwald.png" alt="Bosco misto">Bosco misto</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sumpf.png" alt="Palude">Palude</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/moor.png" alt="Torbiere">Torbiere / Acquitrini</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/roehricht.png" alt="Canneti">Canneti</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/watt.png" alt="Zona di marea">Piana di marea</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sand.png" alt="Sabbia">Spiaggia, Sabbia</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/geroell.png" alt="Ghiaione">Ghiaione / Pietraia</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gehoelz.png" alt="Boschetto">Zona boschiva / Boscaglia</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wiese.png" alt="Prato">Prato / Pascolo</li>
            <li class="legend-item"></li>
            
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wein.png" alt="Vigneto">Vigneto</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/friedhof.png" alt="Cimitero">Cimitero</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schrebergarten.png" alt="Orti urbani">Orti urbani</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sperrgebiet.png" alt="Zona riservata">Zona riservata / Proibita</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergbau.png" alt="Attività estrattiva">Miniera, Cava</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    
    <hr/>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Linee</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/stromleitung.png" alt="Elettrodotto">Elettrodotto</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/seilbahn.png" alt="Funivia">Funivia / Impianto</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"></li> 

            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/boeschung.png" alt="Scarpata">Scarpata / Terrapieno</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/deich.png" alt="Argine">Argine</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"></li> 

            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/zaun.png" alt="Recinzione">Recinzione</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/hecke.png" alt="Siepe">Siepe</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr/>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Simboli</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kirche.png" alt="Chiesa">Chiesa</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kapelle.png" alt="Cappella">Cappella</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/burg.png" alt="Castello">Castello, Fortezza</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/burgruine.png" alt="Rovine di castello">Rovine di castello</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schloss.png" alt="Palazzo">Palazzo, Dimora</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schlossruine.png" alt="Rovine di palazzo">Rovine di palazzo</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sportplatz.png" alt="Campo sportivo">Campo sportivo</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/stadion.png" alt="Stadio">Stadio</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/turm.png" alt="Torre">Torre</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/aussichtsturm.png" alt="Torre panoramica">Torre panoramica</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wasserturm.png" alt="Torre dell'acqua">Serbatoio a torre</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sendeturm.png" alt="Torre di trasmissione">Torre radio</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/mobilfunkmast.png" alt="Antenna mobile">Antenna cellulare</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/leuchtturm.png" alt="Faro">Faro</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/aussichtspunkt.png" alt="Punto panoramico">Punto panoramico</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/badestelle.png" alt="Zona balneazione">Piscina, Area balneabile</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/camping.png" alt="Campeggio">Campeggio</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergwerk.png" alt="Miniera">Miniera</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergwerk_stillgelegt.png" alt="Miniera dismessa">Miniera (dismessa)</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/muehle.png" alt="Mulino">Mulino</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/denkmal.png" alt="Monumento">Monumento, Memoriale</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wegkreuz.png" alt="Croce di via">Croce di via / edicola</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/huegelgrab.png" alt="Tumulo">Tumulo</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gipfel.png" alt="Vetta">Vetta / Cima</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gipfelkreuz.png" alt="Croce di vetta">Croce di vetta</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/quelle.png" alt="Sorgente">Sorgente</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/hoehle.png" alt="Ingresso grotta">Ingresso grotta</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kreuz.png" alt="Croce">Croce</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sattel.png" alt="Passo">Sella / Valico</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/laubbaum.png" alt="Albero monumentale">Albero monumentale</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/doline.png" alt="Dolina">Dolina</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kraftwerk.png" alt="Centrale elettrica">Centrale elettrica</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/photovoltaikanlage.png" alt="Impianto fotovoltaico">Impianto fotovoltaico</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/windkraftanlage.png" alt="Turbina eolica">Turbina eolica</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schornstein.png" alt="Ciminiera">Ciminiera</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
